block head
    title Muscle Cramps - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Muscle Cramps
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/muscle-cramp/symptoms-causes/syc-20350820") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Muscle cramps occur mostly in leg muscles, most often in the calf. Cramps usually last for seconds to minutes. After the cramp eases, the area might be sore for hours or days.
